            <div xml:id="m-da773fa5-5adf-4713-8248-56e32cede7a6">
              <lg xml:id="m-6f3ded79-8af1-4a02-818a-e82d28299a5d">
                <l xml:id="m-6ae7f164-1ea4-48d4-95f1-ab7aeb59324f" facs="#m-5f0c3107-cb80-4b7c-8b46-5f576b08cfda" label="ambiguous">102e</l><l xml:id="m-9dc6d891-b389-4ec3-965a-1764cbffe2e5" facs="#m-fd769fdc-8925-4dfa-8a05-8262e64a14ce" label="text-like">lith Sunday after Pentecost.</l><l xml:id="m-b39d50e3-945d-473f-9676-673513ce8c68" facs="#m-f8b646f8-b449-496a-baa3-ad6a4e2959c7" label="ambiguous">7.</l><l xml:id="m-167988a2-7d52-4e58-aed3-069a42994470" facs="#m-87b74cd9-a50f-43af-8649-6d5c55b37595" label="ambiguous">h</l><l xml:id="m-15dca450-cff4-43c9-8deb-52c589bda549" facs="#m-733e7cd3-a43e-4731-b4d8-b960e584ffba" label="lyrics-like">Lle-lú-ia.— ij</l><l xml:id="m-8159b54e-8184-40e6-96b2-e4b2b3dc4818" facs="#m-df941e07-936b-4d81-b426-176eaa70dd73" label="lyrics-like">v. Exsultá- te Dé¬ adju-tó-ri</l><l xml:id="m-293a1879-11c8-4745-8fa5-0e3639d7df27" facs="#m-1cde4113-e274-4d2d-a5b4-abe0019e3ea9" label="ambiguous">ju¬</l><l xml:id="m-8eaea173-9261-4acd-93c7-433eb7ab8f7a" facs="#m-75a4bdc2-26e5-425b-9fe4-4826373730a5" label="lyrics-like">nó- stro,</l><l xml:id="m-23f410f8-300f-4023-9687-99fb09f940a5" facs="#m-d1efa90e-dc76-4d47-b326-d5d884b81c4c" label="lyrics-like">bi-lá-te</l><l xml:id="m-b0eeb5e2-d309-410f-a5cf-a3bfd99b29be" facs="#m-488d2f6c-21a5-4bab-8d90-1582992782a3" label="lyrics-like">Dé¬</l><l xml:id="m-6413e15c-cb1d-4a11-93de-892072c85758" facs="#m-cb640e72-d76a-4de8-ac81-6b542ba783ff" label="lyrics-like">Já-cob: súmi- te psál¬</l><l xml:id="m-fda6c644-ea01-4422-a317-2aec5102c840" facs="#m-ce5da56a-37a7-49e8-99ee-573332ef0ecc" label="ambiguous">o</l><l xml:id="m-989194c7-ea84-4f11-8bf3-c0949fd0f02f" facs="#m-d053e5e2-350c-4cea-8892-a3552753b91f" label="lyrics-like">mum jucúndum</l><l xml:id="m-55ff85b2-699c-4952-aba9-1b36de47b851" facs="#m-81ee8777-eeec-4040-b903-f5822199f103" label="lyrics-like">"cum cí-tha-ra.</l><l xml:id="m-a520e056-aaca-4745-9163-4096de05e182" facs="#m-706bd49b-4564-468d-888f-081f5ea0d786" label="ambiguous">1 Sequentia sancti Evangelli secundum Marcum. Marc. 7. d.</l><l xml:id="m-d435069c-8bb3-44e1-b06b-6a7af0f5d89b" facs="#m-4c48de45-af40-47f8-8d26-da0c9ce03a5d" label="lyrics-like">N illo témpore: Exiens Jesus de ait illi: Ephphetha, quod est ada¬</l><l xml:id="m-b5db33b0-8126-46c6-b502-568804f3ad53" facs="#m-c536949c-1685-4183-a9c0-c2a4654b8eb0" label="lyrics-like">L finibus Tyri, venit per Sidónem</l><l xml:id="m-cb1b8696-2366-49be-8be2-be03fd33d19e" facs="#m-86532331-0163-4229-ac78-33621deda016" label="lyrics-like">perire. Et statim apértae sunt aures</l><l xml:id="m-dc0b9671-2aa7-4430-acbd-bf0603c85977" facs="#m-df90073c-350a-4740-aea0-045029d4c4f8" label="lyrics-like">ad mare Galilaéae inter médios fines</l><l xml:id="m-a0e4465f-23a0-4881-9756-9c8a9e284660" facs="#m-9643c38a-8e0d-4de2-9ee8-7cec1a667585" label="lyrics-like">ejus, et solútum est vinculum lin¬</l><l xml:id="m-0da1d5ce-c369-429f-ab22-93bf0e429ce9" facs="#m-e62151f5-c54d-46f6-8fb1-46856efc7e1e" label="lyrics-like">Decapóleos. Et addúcunt ei surdum</l><l xml:id="m-ed1cba9a-069f-4d1e-9dc6-f05210ff070d" facs="#m-6d6bb840-a532-41c1-8e43-7f8c699155e1" label="lyrics-like">guae ejus, et loquebátur recte. Et</l><l xml:id="m-579c40e3-10ad-4c9d-92c5-73634c62eba2" facs="#m-36655720-f825-4bb5-9251-45255c5c28b8" label="lyrics-like">et mutum, et deprecabántur eum,</l><l xml:id="m-90f1b4e3-e76f-4828-85dd-6779369914ae" facs="#m-0b0e7ddc-ef1e-4af1-b6a1-334c64b2ae8d" label="lyrics-like">praecépit illis ne cui dícerent. Quan¬</l><l xml:id="m-2be41ca0-3601-499d-b371-17aec20b5002" facs="#m-5b75c53e-1617-4375-9504-f5c807921303" label="lyrics-like">ut impónat illi manum. Et appre¬</l><l xml:id="m-5d4906bf-d0fa-48f0-8634-b9eaae7b1158" facs="#m-1bc2a273-a8ae-4164-b13f-497f7fadd7da" label="lyrics-like">to autem eis praecipiébat, tanto</l><l xml:id="m-faa0bc08-fa93-44f4-959d-dfea357cef63" facs="#m-95c1feff-9968-4c42-9e1f-4e930ce633a3" label="lyrics-like">héndens eum de turba seórsum, mi¬</l><l xml:id="m-91f622a6-800b-47e6-b3e8-df03ab3d4b6e" facs="#m-b45e923a-51bb-45c0-991b-56f05fd87a2c" label="lyrics-like">magis plus praedicábant: et eo</l><l xml:id="m-a0612f05-4d5c-46a4-a728-491f18e8ed01" facs="#m-f15c303c-29c6-485f-b054-9428119cb615" label="lyrics-like">ámplius admirabántur, dicéntes:</l><l xml:id="m-d0da612e-c18d-465e-9023-7c95000b13ed" facs="#m-53fde58f-426e-4c75-8954-eedeaa5ac269" label="lyrics-like">sit dígitos suos in auriculas ejus: et</l><l xml:id="m-95bc38b4-9296-4c61-a5ae-35963bd18aaf" facs="#m-b069616b-584c-42e0-9aaf-0ae4f1fdda5b" label="lyrics-like">éxspuens, tétigit linguam ejus: et</l><l xml:id="m-2c478872-d1f6-474e-8240-945120d5fe51" facs="#m-d87d4acb-edaf-44d1-b751-5d28c9d6aab2" label="lyrics-like">Bene ómnia fecit : et surdos fecit</l><l xml:id="m-4d3decad-ebaf-4c3d-8ff1-143166f5ecb3" facs="#m-7dcaa14f-0148-4478-a0cf-b70fc17914fc" label="lyrics-like">suspiciens in caelum, ingémuit, et  audire, et mutos loqui. Credo.</l><l xml:id="m-554c89cc-1381-43fe-974e-8ce887f957fa" facs="#m-c33c096c-230b-419f-8876-1e95eba0dfab" label="lyrics-like">Offertory. Exaltábo te. p. 528.</l><l xml:id="m-084f4e59-f14e-4f2e-9d8e-5fefa8bc80eb" facs="#m-29b40ecf-b550-445b-8e4b-7d5f2327efe0" label="ambiguous">Secret.</l><l xml:id="m-ec28ddf2-9754-422d-bd21-6fa73f1ba997" facs="#m-e3aca612-cf25-4d9c-aaa0-a69948a49c98" label="lyrics-like">Espice, Dómine, quaésumus, no- ptum, et sit nostrae tragilitátis sub¬</l><l xml:id="m-f7ebb413-f663-43a9-8b33-0ca740501d29" facs="#m-5fd0675e-d91a-42ff-ae9f-d03e565676ef" label="lyrics-like">It stram propítius servitútem: ut sidium. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-4ad713eb-f2f5-4426-a21e-c449d15c513e" facs="#m-43e5e876-6651-4f47-924d-099589fd4059" label="lyrics-like">quod offérimus, sit tibi munus accé¬</l><l xml:id="m-b9c4bb42-0793-4799-a12d-09874a3777a0" facs="#m-ceead960-1718-4c24-9138-9e145c22d461" label="lyrics-like">2. Exáudi nos. p. 501. — 3. At the priest's choice.</l><l xml:id="m-6621a17b-dc8e-48d0-96f2-e4e41f535ec7" facs="#m-0fb8a7f3-3179-4f9e-aca5-b1c275c50122" label="ambiguous">comm.!</l><l xml:id="m-31fc8eec-d63a-429d-a42c-173cf9e0996b" facs="#m-4e6de530-c5fe-41e2-bb61-495ea7f94e70" label="ambiguous">6.</l><l xml:id="m-23185a89-d241-4136-97d0-ef90fa7eeb8b" facs="#m-28c126f0-bfdf-4135-ac61-6278db2f1163" label="lyrics-like">L Onó-ra"“Dó-mi-num de tú¬</l><l xml:id="m-177e637f-9d9f-4749-b424-d9d25dc0f2c3" facs="#m-935c0802-83b5-4e32-9515-813a104718d1" label="lyrics-like">stán</l><l xml:id="m-6578d6e4-cff0-4bf7-bb5c-644a9e2bccde" facs="#m-680e15eb-9ac4-48fe-909d-7c2f7627e579" label="ambiguous">a sub¬</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
